### Netcup SCP API — Images
# Server image (re)installation, image flavours, and user-uploaded images.

### List Available Image Flavours for Server
# Only shows images whose storage driver is supported by the server's machine type
GET {{base_url}}/servers/{{server_id}}/imageflavours
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Install Image on Server (DESTRUCTIVE — async — returns task UUID)
# WARNING: All data on the selected disk will be lost!
POST {{base_url}}/servers/{{server_id}}/image
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "imageFlavourId": 0,
  "diskName": "vda",
  "rootPartitionFullDiskSize": true,
  "hostname": "server.example.com",
  "locale": "en_US.UTF-8",
  "timezone": "Europe/Berlin",
  "additionalUserUsername": null,
  "additionalUserPassword": null,
  "sshKeyIds": [],
  "sshPasswordAuthentication": false,
  "customScript": null,
  "emailToExecutingUser": true
}

### Install User Image on Server (DESTRUCTIVE — async — returns task UUID)
POST {{base_url}}/servers/{{server_id}}/user-image
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "key": "REPLACE_WITH_IMAGE_KEY",
  "diskName": "vda"
}

### List User-Uploaded Images
GET {{base_url}}/users/{{user_id}}/images
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Get Presigned Download URL for User Image
GET {{base_url}}/users/{{user_id}}/images/REPLACE_WITH_IMAGE_KEY
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Prepare Image Upload
POST {{base_url}}/users/{{user_id}}/images/REPLACE_WITH_IMAGE_KEY
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Get Presigned URL for Image Upload Part
GET {{base_url}}/users/{{user_id}}/images/REPLACE_WITH_IMAGE_KEY/REPLACE_WITH_UPLOAD_ID/parts/REPLACE_WITH_PART_NUMBER
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Complete Multipart Image Upload
PUT {{base_url}}/users/{{user_id}}/images/REPLACE_WITH_IMAGE_KEY/REPLACE_WITH_UPLOAD_ID
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Delete User Image
DELETE {{base_url}}/users/{{user_id}}/images/REPLACE_WITH_IMAGE_KEY
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
